\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">明日香专属毕业武器，可同时提供全伤暴击率物伤SP回复效果</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/10/91006211/69e72d525d760fb8b8d556fa26b795a1_6381339855263766147.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">朗基努斯之枪能够针对明日香角色提供蓄力、SP攻击、必杀技的全伤害与暴击率提升效果，特有的投技印记与协助攻击效果使其队友分支与蓄力命中时能为明日香恢复能量，加速流程循环以提升分数。除此之外，其能够无条件提升物理伤害的被动也使其具备一定泛用性。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/10/91006211/69e72d525d760fb8b8d556fa26b795a1_6381339855263766147.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
